{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"LOAD \"Graphics/Backgrounds/berg.png\"\n\n\nSCREEN ALPHA 0, 0          ; Start with a black screen\nSCREEN FADE 0, 255, 120    ; Fade in the whole layer over 2 s\n\nSPRITE LOAD 1, \"Graphics/Sprites/hero.png\"\nSPRITE #1,1,160, 120,1\nSPRITE ON 1\n\nMainLoop:\n    IF LAYERFADING(0) = 0 THEN\n        ; The screen is fully visible, start the game\n        IF KEYSTATE(\"SPACE\") = 1 THEN\n            SCREEN FADE 0, 0, 60   ; Fade out everything over 1 s\n            SPRITE FADE 1, 0, 60\n        ENDIF\n    ENDIF\n    WAIT VBL\nGOTO MainLoop","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}